<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<%- include('partials/html-head'); -%>
	<body>
		<div id="app" class="wrap prose" v-cloak>
			<%- include('partials/header', { heading: 'Terms of service' }); -%>

			<section>
				<p>
					By using <strong>Pushie</strong> (referred to as “we”, “our”, or “us”), you agree to the following Terms of
					Service. If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use our services.
				</p>

				<h3>What Pushie Does</h3>
				<p>
					Pushie lets users publish short text updates - called <strong>pushes</strong> - to their personal channel
					(@username). These updates are delivered via browser push notifications to subscribers.
				</p>

				<h3>Accounts and Publishing</h3>
				<p>
					To publish pushes, you must create an account. Your channel belongs to you, and only you can post to it. You
					are solely responsible for the content you publish on your channel.
				</p>

				<h3>Content and Conduct</h3>
				<p>By using Pushie, you agree not to post content that is:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Unlawful,</li>
					<li>Harmful,</li>
					<li>Spammy,</li>
					<li>Or that violates the rights of others.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>You are also responsible for ensuring your content complies with local laws.</p>

				<h3>Ownership and Usage</h3>
				<p>You own your content - all of it.</p>
				<p>By publishing on Pushie, you grant us a license to:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Deliver your pushes to subscribers,</li>
					<li>Temporarily store and display your content,</li>
					<li>Let others read and receive your content via the platform.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>We will never sell your content.</p>
				<p>
					Pushes are stored for <strong>24 hours</strong> and then automatically deleted. We do not offer long-term
					storage, so please keep backups if needed.
				</p>

				<h3>Disclaimers</h3>
				<p>Pushie is provided <strong>“as is.”</strong> We do our best, but we can’t promise:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>The service will always be available,</li>
					<li>That every push will be delivered,</li>
					<li>Or that data will be preserved beyond 24 hours.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>If something goes wrong, we are not liable for any loss or damages.</p>

				<h3>External Links</h3>
				<p>
					Some users may include links in their pushes. We are not responsible for the content on those external sites.
				</p>

				<h3>Privacy</h3>
				<p>
					Your privacy is important to us. Please review our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for information on
					how we handle your data.
				</p>

				<h3>Termination</h3>
				<p>
					We may suspend or terminate your access to Pushie at any time, without notice, if we believe you have violated
					these Terms of Service.
				</p>

				<h3>Changes to the Terms</h3>
				<p>
					We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be posted on this page, and by
					continuing to use the service, you agree to the updated terms.
				</p>

				<h3>Contact Us</h3>
				<p>
					If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at
					<a href="mailto:hello@pushie.net">hello@pushie.net</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
